{"id": "section-body-00677", "title": "Approach to Stridor", "chapterId": "chapter-one", "blocks": [{"id": "body-00677", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading2", "text": "Approach to Stridor", "runs": [{"text": "Approach"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "to"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Stridor"}], "level": 2, "list": {"level": 1, "numberingId": "1890"}}, {"id": "body-00678", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "Stridor is an abnormal, high-pitched sound produced by turbulent airflow through a partially obstructed airway. Stridor is a dangerous finding and may indicate imminent airway obstruction. It can be inspiratory, expiratory or biphasic.", "runs": [{"text": "Stridor is an abnormal, high-pitched sound produced by turbulent airflow through a partially obstructed airway. Stridor is a dangerous finding and may indicate imminent airway obstruction. It can be inspiratory, expiratory or "}, {"text": "biphasic."}]}, {"id": "body-00679", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading4", "text": "Clinical Presentation:", "runs": [{"text": "Clinical"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Presentation:"}], "level": 4}, {"id": "body-00680", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Hypoxia", "runs": [{"text": "Hypoxia"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1866"}}, {"id": "body-00681", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Respiratory distress", "runs": [{"text": "Respiratory"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "distress"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1866"}}, {"id": "body-00682", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Altered mental status", "runs": [{"text": "Altered"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "mental"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "status"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1866"}}, {"id": "body-00683", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Inability to speak", "runs": [{"text": "Inability"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "to"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "speak"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1866"}}, {"id": "body-00684", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Inability to swallow", "runs": [{"text": "Inability"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "to"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "swallow"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1866"}}, {"id": "body-00686", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading4", "text": "Differential diagnoses", "runs": [{"text": "Differential"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "diagnoses"}], "level": 4}, {"id": "body-00687", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "Infectious causes- croup, epiglottitis, peri-tonsillar abscess, retropharyngeal abscess, non-infectious causes- Foreign body obstruction, burns, trauma, anaphylaxis, malignancy, laryngotracheomalacia, stenosis.", "runs": [{"text": "Infectious causes- croup, epiglottitis, peri-tonsillar abscess, retropharyngeal abscess, non-infectious causes- Foreign body obstruction, burns, trauma, anaphylaxis, malignancy, laryngotracheomalacia, stenosis."}]}, {"id": "body-00688-textbox1-00001", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "Note: Assess the airway (If unstable, consider surgical intervention/consult; if stable, consider imaging or direct visualization of larynx with fiberoptic scope or video laryngoscope", "runs": [{"text": "Note:", "bold": true}, {"text": " ", "bold": true}, {"text": "Assess"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "airway"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "(If"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "unstable,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "consider"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "surgical"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "intervention/consult;"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "if"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "stable,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "consider"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "imaging"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "or"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "direct visualization of larynx with fiberoptic scope or video laryngoscope"}]}, {"id": "body-00689", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading4", "text": "Investigations", "runs": [{"text": "Investigations"}], "level": 4}, {"id": "body-00690", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "Blood gases analysis, Lateral neck X-ray (for foreign body, masses or soft tissue swelling), CXR (foreign body, evidence of aspiration), CT- scan Neck, Blood Sugar, Lactate, Electrolyte analysis, and/or Serum creatinine and urea", "runs": [{"text": "Blood"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "gases"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "analysis,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Lateral"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "neck"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "X-ray"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "(for"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "foreign"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "body,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "masses"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "or"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "soft"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "tissue"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "swelling),"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "CXR"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "(foreign"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "body, "}, {"text": "evidence"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "of aspiration), CT-"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "scan"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Neck,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Blood"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Sugar, Lactate, Electrolyte"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "analysis, and/or"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Serum"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "creatinine"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "and"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "urea"}]}, {"id": "body-00691", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading4", "text": "Non-Pharmacological Management", "runs": [{"text": "Non-Pharmacological"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Management"}], "level": 4}, {"id": "body-00692", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "Keep the patient calm by allowing the patient to assume their most comfortable position. Give oxygen if there are signs of increased work of breathing.", "runs": [{"text": "Keep the patient calm by allowing the patient to assume their most comfortable position. Give oxygen if there are signs of increased work of breathing."}]}, {"id": "body-00693", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading4", "text": "Pharmacological Management", "runs": [{"text": "Pharmacological"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Management"}], "level": 4}, {"id": "body-00694", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "It will depend on the underlying cause. The following medications can be used in the management of stridor;", "runs": [{"text": "It"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "will"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "depend"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "on"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "underlying"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "cause."}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "The"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "following"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "medications"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "can"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "be"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "used"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "in"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "management"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "of"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "stridor;"}]}, {"id": "body-00696", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "A: epinephrine (adrenaline) (nebulization) 0.5mls/kg", "runs": [{"text": "A:", "bold": true}, {"text": " ", "bold": true}, {"text": "epinephrine"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "(adrenaline)"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "(nebulization)"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "0.5mls/kg"}]}, {"id": "body-00697", "type": "paragraph", "style": "Heading3", "text": "AND/OR", "runs": [{"text": "AND/OR"}], "level": 3, "conjunction": true}, {"id": "body-00698", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "B: dexamethasone (PO/IV/IM) 0.15- 0.6mg/kg stat (Max 10mg)", "runs": [{"text": "B:", "bold": true}, {"text": " ", "bold": true}, {"text": "dexamethasone"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "(PO/IV/IM)"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "0.15-"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "0.6mg/kg"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "stat"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "(Max"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "10mg)"}]}, {"id": "body-00699-textbox1-00001", "type": "paragraph", "style": "Normal", "text": "Note:", "runs": [{"text": "Note:", "bold": true}]}, {"id": "body-00699-textbox1-00002", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "Since stridor can be as a result of various causes, management should be focused on the underlying causes", "runs": [{"text": "Since"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "stridor"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "can"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "be"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "as"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "a"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "result"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "of"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "various"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "causes,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "management"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "should"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "be"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "focused"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "on"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the underlying causes"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1886"}}, {"id": "body-00699-textbox1-00003", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "Administer IV fluids (if signs of shock) – refer section on the management of shock", "runs": [{"text": "Administer"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "IV"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "fluids"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "(if"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "signs"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "of"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "shock)"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "–"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "refer"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "section"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "on"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "management"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "of"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "shock"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1886"}}, {"id": "body-00699-textbox1-00004", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "All patients with stridor whose cause have not yet been established must be referred to higher health facilities", "runs": [{"text": "All patients with stridor whose cause have not yet been established must be referred to higher health facilities"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1886"}}], "source": {"file": "medical.docx", "chapter": "Approach to patients with emergency conditions", "start": "body-00677", "end": "body-00699-textbox1-00004"}}